<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- Declares modern HTML5 document structure -->

<html lang="en">
  <!-- Identifies English as the primary language -->

  <head>
    <!-- Contains metadata and stylesheet linkage -->

    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <!-- Sets character encoding to standard UTF-8 -->

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <!-- Ensures proper scaling across mobile and desktop screens -->

    <title>Newspaper Article</title>
    <!-- Displays page title in browser tab -->

    <!-- External stylesheet link -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <!-- Main wrapper element with class newspaper -->
    <div class="newspaper">

      <!-- Newspaper Title Header -->
      <div class="name">The Daily Chronicle</div>

      <!-- Publication Date -->
      <div class="date">October 5, 2026</div>

      <!-- Article Headline -->
      <h1 class="headline">Breakthrough in Clean Fusion Energy Announced</h1>

      <!-- Article Sub-Headline -->
      <h2 class="sub-headline">Scientists achieve historic net energy gain in groundbreaking reactor trial</h2>

      <!-- Article Author -->
      <div class="author">By Eleanor Vance</div>

      <!-- Article Paragraph 1 -->
      <p class="text">
        In a landmark development that promises to reshape the global energy landscape, researchers at the International Energy Institute have successfully demonstrated a self-sustaining fusion reaction yielding significantly more power than required to initiate it.
      </p>

      <!-- Article Paragraph 2 -->
      <p class="text">
        The breakthrough came following months of high-precision plasma confinement experiments. World leaders and environmental organizations have hailed the achievement as a pivotal step toward limitless, zero-carbon electricity for future generations.
      </p>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>
